<Slide style={{ padding: '20px 60px', background: '#F7F4EC' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1D1B16', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>第 12 章 · 排错速查：三个等级，按顺序查</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.62)', marginTop: 6 }}>九成问题落在这三类里；先看现象，再按顺序做检查，不用猜</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, padding: '9px 16px', background: 'rgba(168,68,42,0.12)', border: '1px solid rgba(168,68,42,0.45)', borderRadius: 8 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#A8442A' }}>先查 L1，再查 L2</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 540, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 540, padding: 20, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid rgba(29,27,22,0.10)', borderTop: '4px solid #A8442A', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{ padding: '4px 10px', background: '#A8442A', borderRadius: 6 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>L1 · 起不来</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1D1B16' }}>服务根本没跑</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.80)', lineHeight: 1.72, marginTop: 14 }}>现象：访问 5180 打不开，或 ind-diag status 里某一行不是 running。<br /><br />① 端口被占用：查 3210 / 5180 / 8764 三个端口，杀掉占用的进程再启动。<br /><br />② 命令不返回、报 Service manager timeout：几乎一定是漏了 --detach，服务其实已经起来。<br /><br />③ RAG 起不来：先确认 Python ≥ 3.10，再切镜像源重跑 uv sync，日志看 .runtime/rag.log。</Text>
            <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', padding: '10px 12px', background: 'rgba(168,68,42,0.10)', borderRadius: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#A8442A', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>先看日志再动手：三个日志文件都在 .runtime/ 下</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 540, padding: 20, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid rgba(29,27,22,0.10)', borderTop: '4px solid #B8730F', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{ padding: '4px 10px', background: '#B8730F', borderRadius: 6 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>L2 · 跑不起来</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1D1B16' }}>服务活着，诊断发不出去</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.80)', lineHeight: 1.72, marginTop: 14 }}>现象：点了开始诊断没反应，或立刻失败。<br /><br />① 引擎未登录：跑 claude --version / omp --version 确认 CLI 可用；缺 Key 就补 .env。<br /><br />② 返回 400 HARNESS_UNKNOWN：引擎名拼错了，前端下拉里选。<br /><br />③ 返回 409 HARNESS_UNAVAILABLE：引擎没装，换一个已就绪的，或先装 CLI。</Text>
            <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', padding: '10px 12px', background: 'rgba(184,115,15,0.12)', borderRadius: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8A5608', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>先拿 Mock 引擎跑一遍，能通说明是引擎问题不是系统问题</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 540, padding: 20, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid rgba(29,27,22,0.10)', borderTop: '4px solid #2F6FA8', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{ padding: '4px 10px', background: '#2F6FA8', borderRadius: 6 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>L3 · 结果不对</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1D1B16' }}>跑完了但结论奇怪</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.80)', lineHeight: 1.72, marginTop: 14 }}>现象：结论不合理、评分低、或反复重跑。<br /><br />① 先读结论列：COMPETING_SET 不代表失败，它是在告诉你数据不足以区分假设，页面上会列出「最小判别数据集」。<br /><br />② 检查问题栏写清楚没有 —— 泛泛的问题只会得到泛泛的结论。<br /><br />③ 查 .pipeline_events.jsonl 确认是否真的执行完；没跑完的运行不算证据。</Text>
            <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', padding: '10px 12px', background: 'rgba(47,111,168,0.10)', borderRadius: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#2F6FA8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>不确定是否正常？去引擎运行页看产物覆盖是否齐全</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.45)' }}>三张卡已按「先看现象 → 再定位」的顺序排好</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.45)' }}>30 / 31</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
